":"A perfect app for finding the vocal range and practicing your singing. Sing Whiz is designed to help you improve your vocal skills and technique. The app is suitable for singers of all levels. \n\nSing Whiz also helps in finding artists whose voices match yours. After finding your vocal range, it will search for artists with similar ranges. This is a great way to find new songs to sing or listen to, or to find artists to collaborate with.\n\nSing Whiz includes a variety of interactive exercises to help you warm up your voice, improve your pitch and tone, and develop your vocal range.\n\nWith its easy-to-use interface, you can quickly and accurately measure your range, track your progress, and get feedback on your singing. \n\nBest experienced with Headphones!\n\nP.S Write a review or send feedback to hello@dhwaper.com\n\nSee Terms & Conditions in their entirety here \nhttps://dhwaper.notion.site/termsandconditions\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://dhwaper.notion.site/privacypolicy","currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-11-18T18:48:11Z","userRatingCount":22}